<title>UK: London offshore tea auction offerings.</title>
<headline>London offshore tea auction offerings.</headline>
<text>
<p>Offshore offering for the Mar 3 London Tea Auction Totalled 4,800 packages of 53.50 kgs against 5,000 pkgs on Feb 24.</p>
<p>							   Last	  Prev</p>
<p>Kenya O/Sh Pkgs	    CIF   Offshore     1,000	   800</p>
<p>Malawi O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 800	 1,600</p>
<p>Zimba. O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore     2,400	 2,600</p>
<p>Uganda O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 200	   nil</p>
<p>Madagascar O/Sh Pkgs     CIF   Offshore	 400	   nil</p>
<p>Mar 3 landed packages already listed totalled 4,291.</p>
</text>
